~ get_bat
do freezePlayer()
*Its a dinky metal bat, it feels hollow. At the tip its covered in old blood.*
Queen:  If it was good enough for its last owner, its good enough for you.
*It may be a little big but its yours now. "Metal Bat" was added to your inventory.*
do playSound("res://resources/sfx/Common/Chequered Ink/map_open.wav")
do giveItem("Metal Bat")
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END